  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>B</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mstyle><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Using&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>-</m